   ],
   "gap": "The construction or argument and the full treatment promised by proved=annex:p15.product-gaussian-comparison are missing for the promised case 'singular otherwise' (body handbook/parts/p15/density-martingales-and-product-measures.tex lines 237-238). The annex (handbook/annex/p15/density-martingales-and-product-measures.tex lines 362-363) derives that assertion only from 'the affinity series criterion and its reverse-measure conclusion'. As stated, thm:p15-product-affinity-series gives only mu<<nu iff sum(1-h_m)<infinity, and the reverse-measure conclusion gives only nu<<mu. Neither yields mu perp nu when sum(1-h_m)=infinity. The step sum(1-h_m)=infinity => H_infinity=0 => mu perp nu (via thm:p15-product-affinity-criterion) is not written, so the failure condition 'missing promised direction/case' holds for this case.",
